      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4118,
      "text": "On the Day of Resurrection, you will see those who lied against Allah with their faces darkened. Is there not in Hell an abode for the arrogant?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4119,
      "text": "But Allah will save those who fear Him, for they have attained salvation[18]; no harm will touch them, nor will they grieve.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4120,
      "text": "Allah is the Creator of all things, and He is the Guardian over everything.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4121,
      "text": "To Him belong the keys of the heavens and earth. As for those who disbelieve in the verses of Allah, it is they who are the losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4122,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “Do you order me to worship other than Allah, O ignorant people?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 402,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4123,
      "text": "It has already been revealed to you and to those who came before you that if you associate others with Allah, your deeds will surely become worthless, and you will certainly be among the losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 402,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4124,
      "text": "Rather, worship Allah alone and be among those who are grateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 465,
      "ruku": 402,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4125,
      "text": "They did not revere Allah His true reverence[19]. On the Day of Resurrection, the whole earth will be in His Grip, and the heavens will be rolled up in His Right Hand. Glorified and exalted is He above all what they associate with Him!",
      "surah": {
